# 🛡️ PhishAI – Phishing & Spam Detection Backend

PhishAI is a lightweight backend service for classifying phishing and spam text using a pre-trained ML model. Built with FastAPI, it delivers real-time predictions, clean architecture, and flexible model swapping.

## 🚀 Features

- FastAPI-based backend

- ML model + vectorizer for phishing detection

- Real-time text classification

- Modular design: swap model or vectorizer anytime

- CORS-enabled for any frontend

- Lightweight & deploy-ready

## 🧠 How It Works

- The backend loads a vectorizer and trained ML model.

- The user sends plain text to the `/predict` endpoint.

- Text is transformed into numerical features.

- Model predicts phishing or safe.

- JSON response is returned instantly.

## 📦 Project Structure

app.py – FastAPI application  
model.pkl –  classifier model  
vector.pkl – model vectors


## 🔧 Installation

- Create a virtual environment
~~~
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
~~~

- Install dependencies from requirements.txt
~~~
pip install -r requirements.txt
~~~

- Start the FastAPI server
~~~
uvicorn app:app --reload 
~~~

## 📡 API Endpoints

`POST /predict`
Send text → receive prediction (phishing / safe)

## 🎯 Use Cases

- Website security dashboards

- Browser extensions

- Automation tools

- Email/message filtering

